# Pairs with HandOffMeetsCoreClose (H -> C). HandOffBound is dropped, so a close records a
# head at or below a foreign append of its window.
MODULE: HandOffMeetsCoreCloseHeadUnbounded
TARGET: HandOffMeetsCoreClose
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: HandOffBound is dropped

--- FIND
Guarantees ==
    /\ ClaimHeadCoversPriorAppends
    /\ RaisedEpochUnique
    /\ StaleEpochNeverAppends
    /\ HandOffBound
    /\ StraddlerBelowInit
    /\ BulkHintBound
--- REPLACE
Guarantees ==
    /\ ClaimHeadCoversPriorAppends
    /\ RaisedEpochUnique
    /\ StaleEpochNeverAppends
    /\ StraddlerBelowInit
    /\ BulkHintBound
--- END
